# Agent tooling (not part of the app). The shared config -- subagents, slash
# commands, skills -- is committed so a fresh checkout has it; the weekly roadmap
# routine runs in a throwaway worktree and would otherwise get none of it.
# Everything else under .claude/ is per-machine state or scratch and stays out.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/skills/

# 54 bundled TTF fonts, 7.1 MB -- four times the rest of this repo, for a
# poster-design skill nothing here uses.
.claude/skills/canvas-design/

.mcp.json

# Playwright MCP scratch (page snapshots, console logs) from browser-verifying a change.
.playwright-mcp/
